PM Aleksander Norvik revealed a €1.4 billion defence package today, aiming to strengthen Veridia’s security for the next five years 🛡️. The plan focuses on air defence upgrades and new coastal patrol vessels, with funding released annually pending parliamentary approval. This initiative should also provide a significant boost to Veridia’s shipbuilding sector 🚢. Norvik stated the move underscores Veridia’s dedication to regional stability.
